WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.845
Before creating a view make four decisions Choose a
meaningful name

00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:14.520
Define the row grain Choose the columns
intentionally Then

00:00:14.546 --> 00:00:20.202
write the SELECT that implements that interface
Starting with the contract

00:00:20.228 --> 00:00:22.465
makes the SQL easier to evaluate
